# A permission tinting example that uses all five symbols.
#
# Color names are free-form: here default / protect / delete / archive / inspect
# are business meanings of this example, and the language reads them as ordinary names.

- root
    @ default

    > protect
        | adminPanel
        - userData
            @ protect
            > delete
                | tempFile
            ~ systemCache
                @ delete

    - mods
        @ archive
        > inspect
            | manifest.json
